{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/main/themes/schema.json",
  "$comment": [
    "Puerto fiel del tema 'vscode' de oh-my-bash (el que usa la capa bash) para",
    "que el prompt de Windows se vea igual que en Linux/WSL.",
    "Estructura original (themes/vscode/vscode.theme.sh):",
    "  <usuario verde> <flecha roja si fallo> <ruta azul claro> (<rama>) $",
    "  - usuario: ANSI 0;32  -> green",
    "  - flecha:  ANSI 1;31 cuando el ultimo comando fallo -> brightRed",
    "  - ruta:    ANSI 1;34 -> brightBlue, PROMPT_DIRTRIM=4",
    "  - rama:    parentesis ANSI 0;36 (cyan), nombre ANSI 1;31 (brightRed)",
    "  - sucio:   ANSI 1;33 (brightYellow) con el glifo de oh-my-bash",
    "Los colores salen de config/theme/dracula.env (mismos slots ANSI)."
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "alignment": "left",
      "segments": [
        {
          "foreground": "#50fa7b",
          "style": "plain",
          "template": "{{ .UserName }} ",
          "type": "session"
        },
        {
          "foreground": "#f8f8f2",
          "foreground_templates": [
            "{{ if gt .Code 0 }}#ff6e6e{{ end }}"
          ],
          "style": "plain",
          "template": "\u279c ",
          "type": "status"
        },
        {
          "foreground": "#d6acff",
          "options": {
            "home_icon": "~",
            "max_depth": 4,
            "style": "full"
          },
          "style": "plain",
          "template": "{{ .Path }} ",
          "type": "path"
        },
        {
          "foreground": "#8be9fd",
          "style": "plain",
          "template": "(",
          "type": "git"
        },
        {
          "foreground": "#ff6e6e",
          "options": {
            "branch_icon": ""
          },
          "style": "plain",
          "template": "{{ .HEAD }}",
          "type": "git"
        },
        {
          "foreground": "#ffffa5",
          "style": "plain",
          "template": "{{ if or .Working.Changed .Working.Untracked }} \u2717{{ end }}",
          "type": "git"
        },
        {
          "foreground": "#8be9fd",
          "style": "plain",
          "template": ") ",
          "type": "git"
        },
        {
          "foreground": "#f8f8f2",
          "style": "plain",
          "template": "$ ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "prompt"
    }
  ],
  "final_space": true,
  "version": 4
}
